# PAM session for the TVWallE kiosk (tvwalle-kiosk.service).
# Installed by TVWallE provision/install.sh.
#
# systemd starts this session itself and never asks for a password, so there
# is no auth section. common-session runs pam_systemd, which registers the
# session with logind: that is what gives cage the screen and input devices.
@include common-account
session required pam_loginuid.so
@include common-session
